1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:22,000
I was the sum of my secrets, every lock, every rusted door

2
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Caught my shame into my skin, called it true, called it me and more

3
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:43,000
I tried to bury the bruises, under wordless noise

4
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:53,000
But in the quiet you found me, spoke my name in a broken voice

5
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:00,000
You had my blood on your hands, put my name on your heart

6
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Every wound that I opened, couldn't pull us apart

7
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:13,000
You took my tremor, my terror, all the nights in the dark

8
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:22,000
You had my blood on your hands, put my name on your heart

9
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:31,000
I see your arms in the sunlight, still stained red yet reaching wide

10
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Every failure I rehearse, weeds away where your mercy drives

11
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:48,000
You don't deny what I damage, you don't pretend I'm already whole

12
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:57,000
You just step into the fracture, place your cross in the fracture's hole

13
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:04,000
You had my blood on your hands, put my name on your heart

14
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Every wound that I opened, couldn't pull us apart

15
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:17,000
You took my tremor, my terror, all the nights in the dark

16
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:25,000
You had my blood on your hands, put my name on your heart

17
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:33,000
For the world, yes for the stranger, yes for the sinner

18
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:38,000
Hanging low on their last breath

19
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:45,000
But you look straight through the crowd, through the noise, through the doubt

20
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:52,000
And you whisper, this one, this one right now

21
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:59,000
For every nation, every tongue, every story coming undone

22
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:05,000
But still you lean in close to me, say I won't lose the one I love

23
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:08,000
Oh I'm the one

24
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:15,000
You had my blood on your hands, put my name on your heart

25
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:22,000
Every wound that I opened, couldn't pull us apart

26
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:28,000
You took my tremor, my terror, all the nights in the dark

27
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:36,000
You had my blood on your hands, put my name on your heart

28
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:42,000
So I fall into that mercy, let it finish what it starts

29
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:54,200
Your love is a burning river, and it's running through my scars
